! Default adiabatic MESA profile for:
!   mesa2SISMO profile.data model.madmod
!
! The converter requires only mass (mass or mass_grams), radius_cm, rho,
! pressure, and gamma1. The remaining standard columns below improve model
! metadata or the optional Brunt-Vaisala-weighted remeshing. No custom
! run_star_extras columns are needed.
!
! Use in a MESA inlist with:
!
!   &star_job
!      profile_columns_file = 'profile_columns_sismo_adiabatic.list'
!   /

   zone
   mass
   mass_grams
   radius_cm

   temperature
   rho
   pressure
   gamma1
   brunt_N2

   luminosity
   x_mass_fraction_H
   y_mass_fraction_He
   z_mass_fraction_metals
